ey":"toTown","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"54"},"destinationKey":"condition","guid":"cb16cac5-e6a3-4fb7-9760-c55913908252","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"52"},"sourceKey":"title","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"60"},"destinationKey":"title","guid":"a2bff85d-9c95-46e8-ae23-1c72c4cfd418","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"52"},"sourceKey":"facts","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"60"},"destinationKey":"intention","guid":"3fb9cceb-b6d0-41c6-9132-88e591788bf9","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"72"},"sourceKey":"null","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"70"},"destinationKey":"input","guid":"0f0a5303-776a-4841-95c0-5939f47448e1","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"76"},"sourceKey":"output","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"74"},"destinationKey":"input","guid":"ef10fece-ec4d-403c-a337-3106f84b18aa","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":2060.0,"yMax":500.0},"label":"1. The port''s menu","comment":"Opens on the ''Port menu'' event (sent on arriving, and after each errand). The options are in the words of the port''s people (Game/Data/wording_793.json: Franks, Frisians, English, Northmen...), each with its plain intention under it; then the errands of this kind of place (to come).","color":{"r":0.62,"g":0.45,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"436332a0-009d-44a8-8df4-3400ae0b55a7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2100.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":4200.0,"yMax":940.0},"label":"2. What each choice does","comment":"0: the town (Town - explore the town: up into the map, the market and supplies beside it; the menu again when you''re back at the ship).\n1: talk to people (the waterfront''s news, prices into your ledger).\n2: cast off.\n3 on: the place''s errands (the toll house, the moneyer, lodging, alms...; Code/Game/Ports/PortLife.cs).","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"cafdaa14-39d8-4e44-a273-5d89aec5e8d7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2140.0,"yMin":860.0,"xMax":2760.0,"yMax":1040.0},"title":"Adding an errand","body":"A place''s errands come from wording_793.json (kinds and ports: ''extra''); what each does is in Code/Game/Ports/PortLife.cs (Port: Do errand). Or add an option in group 1 before the errands (Port: Add option, or Text: Add option), add its number to the Switch''s options, and wire what it does from the Switch''s new exit. Your text for each key goes in writing.json.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"e226eba1-79db-4f2f-83d5-b6916050f846","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
    _objectReferences: []
